:"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","package"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Lençóis Maranhenses extension (via Barreirinhas/Atins)","si_tag":"romance","tier":"comfort","source":"https://ambiental.tur.br/destinos/jericoacoara-delta-e-lencois-maranhenses-com-atins/","timing":"Jul-Dec","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the surreal blue-lagoon-in-white-dunes national park ~500 km west via the Rota das Emoções, staged from Barreirinhas or the barefoot village of Atins","si":"romance","blurb":"the surreal blue-lagoon-in-white-dunes national park ~500 km west via the Rota das Emoções, staged from Barreirinhas or the barefoot village of Atins","when":"Jul-Dec","commission":"multi-day romance package via Rota das Emoções DMC (AOR)","wells":["stay","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["romance","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"romance":"primary","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["DMC","package"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Candlelit fresh-fish + terrace-pool sunset","si_tag":"romance","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.humboldttravel.co.uk/hotel/pousada-vila-kalango/","timing":"Jul-Dec","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Vila Kalango''s open-air candlelit fish dinner and sunset-magnet terrace pool","si":"romance","blurb":"Vila Kalango''s open-air candlelit fish dinner and sunset-magnet terrace pool","when":"Jul-Dec","commission":"luxe pousada F&B + honeymoon package","wells":["eat"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["romance"],"shelf_fit":{"romance":"primary","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["package"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to kitesurf in Jericoacoara?","a":"July–December is kite season because the dry-season trade wind blows nearly every day, running ~20–25 kt and building to 30–35 kt on September–November afternoons (strongest in November). This wind is the demand engine, so book schools and pousadas early — the curve switches on around late June / early July.","source":"wakeupstoked.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"What is there to do in Jericoacoara besides the beach?","a":"The signature rituals are free and natural: climb the Sunset Dune (Duna do Pôr do Sol) at dusk to watch the sun drop straight into the Atlantic — one of the few places in Brazil where it does — walk ~45 minutes to the Pedra Furada arch, and float in the wooden hammocks set in the shallows of crystal-clear Lagoa do Paraíso.","source":"nextstopbrazil.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"Is Jericoacoara good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes, but set expectations at barefoot-luxe, not palace-luxury — exquisite bungalows, sand floors and candlelight. Vila Kalango (24 beachfront bungalows, MICHELIN Guide) anchors the lane, and the green Feb–May shoulder sells the quiet, glassy-lagoon honeymoon version when the pousadas discount.","source":"guide.michelin.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Remoteness. Jeri is road-less, so definitive trauma care and complex medical evacuation route through Fortaleza — a 4x4-only, ~4–5 hr ground leg (or JJD air) — then international air evac as needed. Factor that into any emergency-response estimate; travel insurance with medical-evacuation cover is strongly advised.","source":"portaljericoacoara.com.br, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is kitesurfing in Jericoacoara dangerous?","a":"Manageable with the right school: use IKO-certified schools (Rancho do Peixe/Ticowind, Preá Kite Club, North Kite Center, BLU). Central-Jeri offshore wind is not for beginners — they route to Preá''s flat water — and deep-water sessions warrant a life jacket, with a local briefing mandatory because of open-water current.","source":"ikointl.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Jericoacoara & the Ceará Coast, Brazil — Kitesurf Capital, Sunset Dune & Barefoot-Luxe Pousadas | TravelWell.World","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["Jericoacoara o que fazer","kitesurf Jeri","Lagoa do Paraíso","Duna do Pôr do Sol Jeri","Pedra Furada Jericoacoara","transfer Fortaleza Jericoacoara 4x4","Réveillon Jericoacoara","Rota das Emoções roteiro","pousada Jericoacoara frente mar"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"primary_keyword":"Jericoacoara & the Ceará Coast","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:23Z","source_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07"},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"tropical","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Vila Kalango","positioning":"24 beachfront bungalows, MICHELIN Guide, watersports center, candlelit fish","earning":"luxe-pousada commission + package cross-sell","mor":"package via DMC","tier":"premier"},{"name":"Essenza Hotel","positioning":"30-room 5-star, infinity pool, direct beach, sunset-dune views","earning":"affiliate + direct commission","mor":"room affiliate → package","tier":"premier","flag":"Relais & Chateaux affiliation NOT verified — do not claim"},{"name":"My Blue Hotel","positioning":"beachfront, spa, swim-up bar — premium boutique","earning":"affiliate + direct","mor":"room affiliate","tier":"$$"},{"name":"Casa Nomade","positioning":"boutique per prompt — UNVERIFIED this pass","earning":"hold until confirmed","mor":"-","tier":"flag"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Jericoacoara & the Ceará Coast, Brazil, Brazil"},"geo":{"lat":-2.7936,"lng":-40.514},"orbit":[{"id":"fernando-de-noronha-brazil","jewels":9,"si":["liveaboard","tropical","romance","expedition"]},{"id":"salvador-brazil","jewels":13,"si":["culture","tropical","romance","expedition"]}],"orbit_country":["bonito-brazil","foz-do-iguacu-brazil","manaus-amazon-brazil","ouro-preto-tiradentes-brazil","pantanal-brazil","rio-de-janeiro-brazil","sao-paulo-brazil"]}'::jsonb, 53),
  ('la-fortuna-arenal-costa-rica', '10S', 'La Fortuna / Arenal', 'Costa Rica', 'La Fortuna Costa Rica', 'live', 'verified', 'mountainValley', 'Costa Rica', '{"expedition","romance","wellness"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, null, '{"key_facts":["La Fortuna Waterfall drops ~246 ft into a swimmable jade pool below the Arenal cone","Arenal is an active volcano — no summit hikes; hike the 1968 Trail / National Park loops only","Hot springs run ~90-104F, heated by the volcano; resorts range essential to ultra","Whitewater: Rio Balsa (Class II-III family) and Rio Sarapiqui (Class III-IV)","~3-3.5 hr private transfer from San Jose (SJO); local La Fortuna airstrip for small aircraft"],"safety":{"emergency":"911","hospital":"Fortuna Medical Center (La Fortuna, 24hr, +506 6065-9911); Hospital San Carlos Ciudad Quesada (~1hr); major trauma/evac -> CIMA (+506 2208-1000) or Clinica Biblica (+506 2522-1000) San Jose (~3hr)","book_enabled":true,"air_access_verified":true,"volcano":"Active but monitored; viewing safe; NO active-cone summit hikes (1968 Trail / Cerro Chato-area / park loops only)","water":"Generally potable tap water; sensitive travelers may prefer bottled","malaria":"Not a significant malaria zone; dengue present year-round (worse May-Nov) — use DEET repellent","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/costa-rica","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:18Z","page_updated":"2026-05-19T11:42:25+01:00","source_country":"costa-rica","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"inflection_curve_start":"~Dec 15 (dry season opens)","peak":"mid-Dec to Apr (25-40% premium); Xmas/NY + Easter super-peak","fire_date":"Dec 1 (general dry-season, curve-start minus 1-2 wks); Oct 1 for 12-mo holiday/ultra inventory","shoulder":"May & November","green":"May-Nov (20-40% lower rates, lush, fullest waterfalls)","booking_lead":"