","si":"expedition","blurb":"uninhabited UNESCO desert island — beaches, sea lions, snorkel","commission":"local operator + DMC","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal","expedition","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"evidenced","expedition":"primary","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["operator","DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Playa Balandra day trip (El Hongo)","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"live","tier":"essential","bookable":"transfer/tour or self-drive + CONANP bracelet","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puerto_Balandra,_Baja_California_Sur","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Mexico''s most photographed beach, shallow turquoise flats, protected","si":"tropical","blurb":"Mexico''s most photographed beach, shallow turquoise flats, protected","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"DMC transfer + GYG affiliate","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"destination","tropical":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Malecon + sunset sail","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"live","tier":"premier","bookable":"catamaran/sail charter","source":"https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/swim-with-whale-sharks-la-paz/","hook":"La Paz''s waterfront promenade and calm-bay sunset cruises","si":"tropical","blurb":"La Paz''s waterfront promenade and calm-bay sunset cruises","commission":"charter operator + Viator affiliate","wells":["move"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"destination","tropical":"primary"},"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Salvatierra wreck dive","si_tag":"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"comfort","bookable":"dive-within-cert charter","source":"https://lapazdivers.com/la-paz-dive-sites/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m, thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m, thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"dive operator + affiliate","wells":["move","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","adventure","diveglobal","ocean","tropical"],"shelf_fit":{"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures":"evidenced","adventure":"evidenced","diveglobal":"primary","expedition":"destination","ocean":"evidenced","tropical":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane","si_raw":"Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures","si_map_basis":"normalised from free text ''Dive Globally / Ocean Adventures'' by gen_normalise_jewel_si"}],"faq":[{"q":"When and how can I swim with whale sharks in La Paz?","a":"October 1 to April 30, on a licensed half-day snorkel in the bay''s protected refuge zone — never scuba. Encounters are capped at 5 swimmers plus a certified guide per shark for 30 minutes, with no touching, to protect the juveniles that feed there.","source":"thoroughlytravel.com / bucketlistbri.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Is La Paz a good island and beach base?","a":"Yes — it is the launch port for the whole Sea-of-Cortez set: protected Balandra, Tecolote, the Malecón waterfront and boat trips to UNESCO-listed Espíritu Santo. It''s the quiet, low-key alternative to the Los Cabos corridor two hours south.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"What is there to dive around La Paz?","a":"The signature dive is the Salvatierra, a 1976 ferry wreck at 18–20 m that''s now a thriving artificial reef, diveable near year-round, plus the El Bajo seamount. La Paz has its own recompression chamber (confirm status at booking) and DAN emergency is +1-919-684-9111.","source":"lapazdivers.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Missing the season, not crime. Whale sharks are gone May–Sep, sea lions close Jun 1–Aug 31, both are snorkel-only (no touch, no scuba), and hurricane season runs Jun–Nov. Book the Oct–Apr window ahead and carry trip insurance for summer/fall.","source":"scubaboard.com / dossier Safety Card, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"La Paz Whale Sharks & Sea Lions: Sea of Cortez Guide","meta_description":"Snorkel with whale sharks (Oct–Apr) and sea lions at Los Islotes, then sail to UNESCO-listed Espíritu Santo — the quiet Baja capital on the Sea of Cortez. When and how to book.","slug":"la-paz-mexico","primary_keyword":"La Paz whale sharks","long_tail":["La Paz whale shark season 2026","swim with sea lions Los Islotes","Espiritu Santo tour from La Paz","Balandra beach La Paz guide","La Paz Sea of Cortez snorkel"],"search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["tiburón ballena La Paz temporada","nadar con lobos marinos Los Islotes","tour Isla Espíritu Santo desde La Paz","Playa Balandra La Paz","snorkel Mar de Cortés La Paz","hoteles boutique La Paz Baja","buceo naufragio Salvatierra"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-04","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"http